						<h1 class="page-title" >Baseball</h1>

					                    	<div class="copy ol-wrapper" >
		<p><img alt="2022 Cougars Baseball " height="504" src="images/Student%20Life/Athletics/Athletics%20News/BASEball%202022%20team%20photo.jpg" style="margin: 5px;" width="848" /></p>
<p style="text-align: left;">The Cougars baseball team is coached by Ryan Magni who took over as head coach after the 2022 season. Magni played for the Cougars in 2011 and 2013 and served as an assistant coach with the team since 2018. The Cougars have reached the State Tournament in six of the past eight seasons that it was held and have advanced to the NJCAA Regional Tournament 29 times in the history of the program. HCC baseball has had 13 athletes earn All-American honors.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;"></p>
<p style="text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><a href="/student-life/athletics-and-fitness/teams/baseball/meet-our-team-2022-baseball">Meet Our Team 2022 - Click Here</a></span></p>
<p style="text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><a href="/student-life/athletics-and-fitness/teams/baseball/meet-our-team-2019-baseball">Meet Our Team 2019 - Click Here</a>&nbsp;</span></p>
<p style="text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><a href="/student-life/athletics-and-fitness/teams/baseball/meet-our-team-2018-baseball">Meet Our Team 2018 - Click Here</a></span></p>
<p style="text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><a href="/student-life/athletics-and-fitness/teams/baseball/meet-our-team-2017-baseball">Meet Our Team 2017 - Click Here</a>&nbsp;</span></p>
<p style="text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><a href="/student-life/athletics-and-fitness/teams/baseball/baseball-photos">Baseball Photos - Click Here</a></span><span style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p style="text-align: left;"><em><span style="font-size: 8pt;">&nbsp;</span></em></p>
<p style="text-align: left;"><em><span style="font-size: 8pt;">Photo: 2022 Cougars Baseball</span></em></p>
<p style="text-align: left;"></p>
	</div>
 						    
                    
                           <hr/>
